sequenceDiagram
    participant G as Gateway gRPC client
    participant P as Plugin gRPC server
    G->>P: PluginService/Stream (HTTP/2)
    G->>P: StreamMessage (context + payload)
    P-->>G: StreamMessage (response/event)
    G->>P: StreamMessage (next chunk/datagram)
    P-->>G: StreamMessage (response/event)
    Note over G,P: HTTP/2 flow control bounds backpressure
    G-xP: context cancellation / deadline
